中 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0（见证据 #3），结合 Kubernetes 配置（见证据 #7）及 Metric 无 OOM 迹象，证明并非内存限制（Limit 96Mi）或 CPU 不足引发。\n- **集群状态**：Kubernetes Event 记录的高频 `BackOff`（见证据 #2）与 K8s 状态 `CrashLoopBackOff` 共同证实了进程反复崩溃重启导致的集群异常表现。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 97.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 97.1s (Evidence 91.0s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 134.69, "metrics": {"run_id": "a098b555655e49ce", "mttr": {"value": "2.2m", "seconds": 134.6988503932953, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_brea